  levelId: level_23
  levelTitle: Triple Barrier - Three Diodes in Series
  initialPage: 0
  pages:
  - title: LEVEL 23 | Triple Barrier | Overview
    explanation: 'TEACHING SCHEMATIC, NOT LIVE MEASUREMENTS. Wire one continuous
      series path: Battery positive -> switch -> 150 Ohm resistor -> D1 -> D2 ->
      D3 -> green LED -> battery negative. Point the banded cathode end of all three
      diodes toward the LED. Do not bypass any diode.'
    caption: PAGE 1/4 | 5 V | SWITCH | 150 OHM | THREE DIODES | LED
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.07, y: 0.53}
      label: 5 V
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.29, b: 0.35, a: 1}
    - id: sw1
      kind: 5
      position: {x: 0.2, y: 0.79}
      label: SW1
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.78, b: 0.28, a: 1}
