  - title: LEVEL 23 | Seven Electrical Wire Connections
    explanation: 'THE SEVEN WIRES: (1) Battery_positive -> SwitchInput. (2) SwitchOutput
      -> R_LIMIT_Input. (3) R_LIMIT_Output -> D_SERIES_1_Anode. (4) D_SERIES_1_Cathode
      -> D_SERIES_2_Anode. (5) D_SERIES_2_Cathode -> D_SERIES_3_Anode. (6) D_SERIES_3_Cathode
      -> LED_Anode. (7) LED_Cathode -> Battery_negative. These are logical binding
      IDs; connect the corresponding SparkTerminal objects in the scene. If a source-to-switch
      wire is preinstalled, the player only needs to place the remaining wires.'
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | CONNECT IN ORDER | THREE FORWARD DIODES
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.07, y: 0.53}
      label: 5 V
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.29, b: 0.35, a: 1}
