  - title: LEVEL 23 | Combined Diode Voltage Drop
    explanation: Each forward-biased 1N4007 has an approximate 0.7 V drop, for a
      combined diode drop of 0.7 + 0.7 + 0.7 = 2.1 V. With an approximately 2.1 V
      green LED drop and a 5 V supply, the 150 Ohm resistor has approximately 0.8
      V and the series current is approximately 5.33 mA. Actual results depend on
      the configured diode and LED models.
    caption: PAGE 3/4 | D1 + D2 + D3 APPROXIMATELY 2.1 V
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.07, y: 0.53}
      label: 5 V
