  - title: LEVEL 23 | Solution and Six Objectives
    explanation: 'TARGETS 6/6: supply 4.8-5.2 V; D1 forward voltage 0.45-1.0 V; D2
      forward voltage 0.45-1.0 V; D3 forward voltage 0.45-1.0 V; green LED ON; resistor
      series current 4.5-6.5 mA. Use 150 Ohm in Slot_01. Diode binding IDs: D_SERIES_1_Component,
      D_SERIES_1_Anode, D_SERIES_1_Cathode; D_SERIES_2_Component, D_SERIES_2_Anode,
      D_SERIES_2_Cathode; D_SERIES_3_Component, D_SERIES_3_Anode, D_SERIES_3_Cathode.
      Fixed LED IDs: led, LED_Anode, LED_Cathode. Only SparkLevelEvaluator can award
      6/6 after a valid solve; the drawing itself does not validate wiring.'
    caption: PAGE 4/4 | 5 V | D1/D2/D3 FORWARD | LED ON | SAFE CURRENT
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.07, y: 0.53}
